{"product_id":"kingdoms-call-kingdom-book-4","title":"Kingdom's Call (Kingdom, Book 4)","description":"\u003cp\u003eA sworn enemy of the Prince vows to eliminate his Followers.Until the Prince saves his life課?For generations the Noble Knights have been in service to the King. Following a strict code of conduct, they preserve the peace in Chessington, the King課ｪs chosen city, and rule its citizenry. Sir Gavin is a young and promising Noble Knight, devoted to King and Code.Then a peasant disrupts the tranquility of Chessington, brazenly challenging the Code while claiming to be the son of the King課ﾒa Prince. When it is learned that he is actively training a force of men in defiance of the law, the stranger is arrested and executed.But his Followers continue to defy the Code, and Sir Gavin swears to destroy this threat to Chessington課ﾒuntil he himself is grievously wounded in battle. As he faces his own death, Gavin is saved by someone who will transform his heart and change his life課?Journey to Arrethtrae, where the King and His Son implement a bold plan to save their kingdom; where courage, faith, and loyalty stand tall in the face of opposition; where good will not bow to evil課ﾒand one brave man stands against the Dark Knight.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 131 x 209\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Chuck Black\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781590527504\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 160\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45297450614937,"sku":"10RC9781590527504","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/Kingdom_sCall_Kingdom_Book4_ChuckBlack.jpg?v=1744480572","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/kingdoms-call-kingdom-book-4","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}